{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Synopsis.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a future of totally immersive virtual worlds, escaping reality has never been easier. In Konekomi Castle, explore the castle full of &quot;Konekomi&quot; \u2013 cat-like people with crazy thought processes. Play as Sakira, and as you make your way through this castle, some Konekomi seem more sentient than others? Find your way out of this game before you become cat-food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Konekomi Castle is a puzzle/adventure game with surreal/horror elements and lots of character interactions. The order in which you experience some parts of the game will be up to you. As you trek through the castle, you can save your progress at dedicated points. A full playthrough of the game should last a few hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Cast.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Sakira.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sakira</strong>, the innocent protagonist, may be the only sane mind in this castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Momo.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Momo</strong>, the waist-high adorable, loves to provide affection to anyone who needs it regardless of their opinion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Jira.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jira</strong>, the super scary, is someone you know is dangerous before you even meet her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Mana.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mana</strong>, the tactical catgirl, seems to have a lot of authority in the castle, and knows a lot more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/TheBigSleepy.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Big Sleepy</strong>, the room-size catgirl, is too tired to provide a description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Vini.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vini</strong>, the unsociable artist, is responsible for almost every painting in the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Devi.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Devi</strong>, the sadistic rogue, carves her own way, right through your stomach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Reta.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reta</strong>, the staircase operator, has only one job, and that's to operate the staircase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Announcer.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Announcer</strong>, or Niko, is well-known for commentating Katjo, the trademark sport in Konekomi Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/TheKonekomi.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Konekomi</strong>, although less powerful than the previously mentioned Nekomi, live all throughout the castle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812300?t=1750635219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812300?t=1750635219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/1a50172919beab9a5402b14f3168e9c4334505fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750635219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/1a50172919beab9a5402b14f3168e9c4334505fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750635219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Synopsis.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a future of totally immersive virtual worlds, escaping reality has never been easier. In Konekomi Castle, explore the castle full of &quot;Konekomi&quot; \u2013 cat-like people with crazy thought processes. Play as Sakira, and as you make your way through this castle, some Konekomi seem more sentient than others? Find your way out of this game before you become cat-food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1750635219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Konekomi Castle is a puzzle/adventure game with surreal/horror elements and lots of character interactions. The order in which you experience some parts of the game will be up t